  "thag2.15:1.1": "jano janasmiṃ sambandho ",
  "thag2.15:1.2": "janamevassito jano ",
  "thag2.15:1.3": "jano janena heṭhiyati ",
  "thag2.15:1.4": "heṭheti ca jano janaṃ. ",
  "thag2.15:2.1": "ko hi tassa janenattho ",
  "thag2.15:2.2": "janena janitena vā ",
  "thag2.15:2.3": "janaṃ ohāya gaccheyya ",
  "thag2.15:2.4": "heṭhayitvā bahuṃ jananti. ",
  "thag2.15:2.5": "sabbamitto thero. 6 "
